  "body": "## What\n\nVersion bump to 5.6.0 covering four merged units since 5.5.1:\n\n1. **Velvet theme** (#104) — a fourth dashboard theme: deep navy base (`#0a1220`) with a vibrant velvet-red accent (`#e6435e`), built with `/ui-ux-pro-max`. Semantic tokens only, measured WCAG contrast (body 15.6:1, accent-on-navy 4.76:1).\n2. **Analytics persistence + Clear filters** (#105) — filters and page restore across refresh; a \"Clear filters\" button resets everything. Fixed a real early-load localStorage race (read persisted state after the first await).\n3. **Test-suite leak guard** (#103) — session-scoped assertion that no FCC-owned background thread survives the run, so a future leak fails loudly instead of filling RAM.\n4. **Docs + screenshots** (#106) — my-claude-code branding, mcc-* commands, and dashboard screenshots retaken against the current UI.\n\n## Verification\n\n- Full suite: 3706 passed, 26 known environmental failures (identical baseline), 26 skipped.\n- ruff format/check + ty all clean.\n- `uv lock` updated (`my-claude-code v5.5.1 -> v5.6.0`).\n\n## Residual risks\n\n- The 26 failures are the documented baseline (16 PowerShell installer + ~10 websearch/env-key), not a regression.\n- Screenshots were retaken on a throwaway server; terminal/desktop captures (cc-model-picker, codex*) still show v4-era UI.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
