    "message": "chore: bump 5.5.1 -> 5.6.0 (MINOR: Velvet theme + analytics persistence + docs)\n\nBatch of four merged units:\n- Velvet theme (#104): deep navy base with a vibrant velvet-red accent, a\n  fourth dashboard theme built with the ui-ux-pro-max skill.\n- Analytics persistence (#105): filters + page restore across refresh (the\n  early-load localStorage race is fixed by reading after the first await),\n  plus a Clear filters button.\n- Test-suite leak guard (#103): session-scoped assertion that no FCC-owned\n  background thread survives the run.\n- Docs + screenshots (#106): my-claude-code branding, mcc commands, and\n  dashboard screenshots retaken against the current UI.\n\nFull suite: 3706 passed, 26 known environmental failures (identical baseline),\n26 skipped. ruff format/check + ty all clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
